Package: studysynth
Title: Synthesize Fake REDCap Study Data from a Spec, Never from Real Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Nate", "Vack", email = "nate@gimlet.us", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads a REDCap project's structure (metadata-only project XML or
    the data dictionary, events, and instrument mapping CSVs) and a YAML spec
    describing how items relate (lavaan syntax), how people change over time
    (lme4-style formulas), screening, dropout, partial sessions, and
    experience sampling. Synthesizes as many imaginary participants as you
    like, in REDCap import format. It never reads real subject data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
